-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Played by the owner in JNext 1.1.104, 2026-11-07: approved. Run
              by script through the real loader on NextZXOS v2.09 and 26.11
              card copies.

  Replay      IDENTICAL on 33 recordings, 131,756 frames, default colours: at
              every hook original and patched code compared from the same
              state, every register with R, working RAM, sprite pixels against
              the original plotter's XOR (249,111 figure plots, 125,499
              picture checks, 96 rooms, 66 figure IDs); A' and rope registers
              overwritten and replayed (dead); 14 of 14 negatives detected;
              all 113 figures at 9 positions, slot, scenery and row cases; 176
              hook cases at 3.5, 7, 14 and 28 MHz with interrupts on and off;
              2,114 injected interrupts

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104 headless: six 12,000-frame soaks (3 seeds a colour
              set), 32,814 player updates a set, deaths and 151 room changes,
              no errors, the default and Enhanced counters equal; beeper
              writes in the original order, all at 3.5 MHz; the real loader
              (.NEXCLASH) on private card copies, NextZXOS v2.09 and 26.11:
              default, Enhanced and Enhanced with all five trainers wrote the
              exact .nex and reached play

  Coverage    Recordings and soaks by script, no human play: menus, play,
              ropes, 96 rooms, deaths, game over, restarts; the ending and
              deep rooms from labelled cheat and teleport starts; not reached:
              natural completion, joysticks

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
